  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge and 4D Gaussian Splatting frameworks enhance 3DGS driving simulations and full-scene perception, while EvoGS and tissue deformation recovery methods improve medical imaging. Both approaches address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging.",
